  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a uniform square plate of side ' $a$ ' and mass ' $m$ '. The moment of inertia of this plate about an axis perpendicular to its plane and passing through one of its corners is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "rqBmJ",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{5}{6} m a^2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "VywkA",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{1}{12} m a^2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "QrUoO",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{7}{12} m a^2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "h1fTH",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{2}{3} m a^2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\nI=I_{c m}+m\\left(\\frac{a \\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)^2=\\frac{m a^2}{6}+\\frac{m a^2}{2}=\\frac{2}{3} m a^2\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
